13. What Are Liveness and Readiness Probes?
Answer
Liveness Probe
Checks:
 
Is application alive?
 
If failed:
 
Restart Pod
 
Readiness Probe
Checks:
 
Can app accept traffic?
 
If failed:
 
Remove from load balancer
 
Actuator readiness/liveness endpoints are recommended for Spring Boot. [Kubernetes...t_80_Pages | PDF]
14. What is Startup Probe?
Answer
Startup Probe protects slow-starting Spring Boot applications.
 
Application starting

↓

Do not execute liveness yet
 
Startup probe delays liveness/readiness evaluation until startup succeeds. [Kubernetes...t_80_Pages | PDF]
